OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA band of
OL,6,Fheavy rain spreads east this evening,
OL,7,Fquickly clearing to leave the rest of
OL,8,Fthe night mainly dry with just the
OL,9,Fchance of a few light showers.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FA bright but rather breezy
OL,12,Fday with a few bright spells between
OL,13,Fscattered showers. Feeling rather
OL,14,Fchilly.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FHeavy
OL,17,Fshowers on Wednesday with a risk of
OL,18,Fthunder. Bright or sunny spells and
OL,19,Fscattered showers thereafter, becoming
OL,20,Fisolated by Friday. Remaining cool
OL,21,Fthroughout.
